Spec: Public contract shapes and examples

Purpose:
  Maintain published application JSON shapes and executable documentation checks.

Owns:
  ./README.md
  ./app-manifest.schema.json
  ./connection-policy.schema.json
  ./rpc-envelope.schema.json
  ./check_contracts.py
  ./requirements-validation.txt

Structure:
  ./examples: Nonsecret representative declarations and messages.

References:
  /docs/SPEC.md
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md

Must:
  Keep shape validation distinct from runtime semantic validation and caller authorization.
